16.Special Malt Beverage Permit for Events at Rodeo Arenas.Pursuant to Wyo.
Stat. Section 12-4-507, the city clerk shall issue a special malt beverage permit for the sale
of malt beverages upon submission of a reasonable plan only at events conducted on the
grounds of an indoor or outdoor rodeo with a total seating capacity of over seven thousand
five hundred (7,500).
